1
00:00:00,569 --> 00:00:04,359
(Past Leonard:)You might be an expert on theoretical
physics and science fiction programs...

2
00:00:04,531 --> 00:00:08,031
(Past Leonard:)...and where to sit on a freaking couch,
but this is applied physics.

3
00:00:08,201 --> 00:00:11,161
And when it comes to applied physics--
Uh-oh.

4
00:00:11,872 --> 00:00:14,662
(Past Howard:)-What's happening?
-A bad thing. A very bad thing.

5
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:15,873
(Past Leonard:)Get the door.

6
00:00:16,043 --> 00:00:19,293
Get the door. Get the door. Get the door.

7
00:00:29,598 --> 00:00:33,018
(Past Howard:)-You're waiting for the elevator?
-Oh, right.

8
00:00:33,185 --> 00:00:34,435
[ELEVATOR BELL DINGS]

9
00:00:34,603 --> 00:00:36,773
(Past Raj:)-Wait. It's here.
-Ah!

10
00:00:39,816 --> 00:00:41,316
(Past Sheldon:)Give me that.

11
00:00:44,946 --> 00:00:46,486
(Past Leonard:)What'd you do that for?
I had plenty of time.

12
00:00:46,656 --> 00:00:47,986
[EXPLOSION]

13
00:00:52,662 --> 00:00:53,662
(Past Sheldon:)You're welcome.

14
00:00:56,917 --> 00:01:00,507
(Leonard:)Not only did Sheldon save my life,
he didn't rat me out to the landlord.

